  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School of Olof Palme in Western Sahara</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Western Sahara. The main outcome areas it contributes to are countering the threats to democracy and human rights and opposing the backlash to increase gender equality. The main right holders are women and men in the refugee camps Aousserd, Dakhla, Laayoune and Smara. Through capacity building activities in gender equality and women&apos;s rights, education in media, communication, computer, science and administration the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
